{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-292",
  "title": "Trica Feedback (2)",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Trica Feedback (2)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hi User,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I provided some rushed answers to the questionnaire that align with the categories that we discussed and some of what you already have."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For the site, I imagined drop down categories on a homepage where users could choose: Bio, Books, Education, Activities/Events etc. Scrolling takes too much time from a user’s perspective."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your film trailer is beautiful, but it contains a lot of copyright protected/intellectual property material, especially the art and film clips.  You’ve also highlighted people & work whose selection would invite unwanted critiques about why X instead of Y type stuff."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Not sure what happened with my moving ocean/water motif, but the opening needs to be scaled back to something simpler. The Marseille and Paris segments at the beginning with the sea and seine could work well, depending on the copyrights."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I think the other activities that I’m doing can be animated with other visuals in a drop-down format."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Move the Baldwin quote to the home page; I don’t want a media/press section – to0 dangerous these days."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Let’s see what you do with this and then arrange a time to meet."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Thanks, and hang in there!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Trica"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}